  "description": "Angel Frey, tired of the same old boring heavenly life. Reading stimulating web novels of the human world was the only pleasure in his life. Then, one day, the news that the serialization of 'Red Temptation', one of his favorite novels, is discontinued... Huh? The writer stopped serializing it because she had no experience? No, no, no, no, I'll make sure you have that 'experience', so please don't stop the serialization!!!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/heaven_M/?p_id=tw898), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/fan_from_heaven)",
